Lab 20: Final Exam Prep: Multi-Cluster Management
Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Set up and configure multiple OpenShift clusters using Red Hat Advanced Cluster Management (RHACM)
Implement and manage governance policies across multiple clusters
Deploy applications to multiple clusters simultaneously
Monitor cluster health and performance metrics
